- If the decision is "reject": say clearly but warmly that they will not move forward for this role, and encourage them to apply for future roles.
- The candidate only submitted an online application. Do not mention calls, interviews or conversations.
- Never mention scores, screening criteria, AI or automation.
- Max 120 words. Sign off as "The Recruiting Team".
- No placeholders like [Company Name].
- Body as simple HTML using <p> tags only.

Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown fences:
{"subject": "...", "body_html": "..."}

